{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "https://graduation.local/contract-specs/schemas/canonical-event.v1.schema.json",
  "title": "canonical-event v1.0 — 统一事件信封与 12 类 typed payload",
  "description": "机器可读投影，语义权威是 docs/contracts/event-contract.md（schema_version 1.0）。本文件逐项对齐该文档 §1（8 字段信封）、§2.1-§2.10（12 类 payload 字段/必填/枚举）、§3（event_type 全集）、§4（金额正则）。两者冲突时以 markdown 文档为准，并须按 V2.1 §9.1 登记契约任务（本目录 README 的权威顺序声明）。\n\n信封是否允许多出未知字段：指导书与事件契约均未规定。event-contract.md §1 L28 的『多出的未知字段不阻止消费（向后兼容）』字面只针对 payload；本 Schema 对根对象采用同样宽松策略（additionalProperties: true），依据是该兼容性原则与 EventEnvelope.java:18 的 @JsonIgnoreProperties(ignoreUnknown = true)（读取侧忽略未知信封字段）。此项未获契约明确授权，见 x-envelope-additional-properties。\n\npayload 内部多余字段：按 §1 L28 明确允许（每个 payload 定义 additionalProperties: true）。缺失必需字段按 §1 L28『视为脏数据』，故 required 严格按 §2 表格取全集。\n\n本文件由 analytics-server/platform-common 的 CanonicalEventSchemaParityTest 做结构对账（信封 8 字段 / 12 类枚举 / schema_version / source_system / 金额正则 / payload 路由）。\n\n真实数据符合度（建立时的实测，供审阅者判断契约与实现的差距）：用本 Schema 校验真实夹具 landing/events/r9-m1-123006.jsonl 的 55 行，26 行通过、29 行不通过（含 1 行 JSON 本身不可解析）。而采集层 EventContractValidator 的规则对同一文件回放的结果是接受 51 行、隔离 4 行，与 landing/manifests/30.json 记录的 acceptedRecords=51 / quarantinedRecords=4 完全一致。也就是说：采集层实际接受的 51 行中约有 25 行按 event-contract.md §2 是脏数据（缺必填时间/status 字段、items 为字符串、channel 取 web 等）。这不表示 Schema 写错，而是表示『契约要求的必填』严于『采集层实际执行的必填』，必须由契约任务决定收紧实现还是放宽契约（README 第 7 节 Q4-Q6）。",
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "event_id": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "全局唯一事件 ID，ODS/DWD 按此去重（允许 at-least-once 投递）。来源：event-contract.md §1 L12。契约 §1 L27 规定 event_id 为 UUID 字符串；但真实夹具 landing/events/r9-m1-123006.jsonl 使用 golden-evt-001 这类非 UUID 值且被采集层接受（landing/manifests/30.json acceptedRecords=51），两处冲突，故本 Schema 只约束 string，不强制 UUID 格式（待契约任务冻结，见 README 待决策）。"
    },
    "event_type": {
      "type": "string",
      "enum": [
        "user_registered",
        "product_created",
        "product_updated",
        "behavior",
        "order_created",
        "order_paid",
        "order_cancelled",
        "refund_created",
        "refund_completed",
        "stock_reserved",
        "stock_released",
        "stock_changed"
      ],
      "description": "事件类型取值全集，合计 12 类。来源：event-contract.md §3 L152-L160；与 EventContract.EVENT_TYPES / EVENT_TYPES 键集一致。未知 event_type → 隔离区（quarantine），不进入 DWD（§3 L160）。"
    },
    "event_time": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/iso8601_time",
      "description": "业务时间（带时区），指标归属依据。来源：event-contract.md §1 L14 + §1 L25（时间一律 ISO-8601 带时区）。"
    },
    "ingest_time": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/iso8601_time",
      "description": "该行的采集时间（Java 侧生成）；链路延迟 = ingest_time - event_time。来源：event-contract.md §1 L15 + §4 L169（每个事件必须同时包含 event_time 与 ingest_time）。"
    },
    "source_system": {
      "const": "mock-mall",
      "description": "固定值：mock-mall。来源：event-contract.md §1 L16『固定值：mock-mall』；与 EventContract.SOURCE_SYSTEM（EventContract.java:17）及 mall-simulator 侧 EventContract.SOURCE_SYSTEM 一致，并由 CanonicalEventSchemaParityTest 锁定为 const。生成器 CANONICAL_EVENT_FILE 模式的 synthetic 标记不落在信封上（信封只有这 8 个字段），见 README 待决策。"
    },
    "schema_version": {
      "const": "1.0",
      "description": "契约版本，当前唯一支持值 1.0。来源：event-contract.md 标题 L1 与 §1 L17；EventContract.SCHEMA_VERSION（EventContract.java:16）。未知版本 → 进入隔离区（quarantine_record），不进入 DWD。升版本规则：新增字段 → 1.1 起；破坏性变更 → 新主版本 + 转换器（event-contract.md L4）。"
    },
    "trace_id": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "一次业务操作一个 trace_id，贯穿 商城→Outbox→日志→批次→ODS。来源：event-contract.md §1 L18。契约 §1 L27 规定 trace_id 为 UUID 字符串；真实夹具（golden-trace-001 形式）与之一致性同 event_id，故只约束 string（见 README 待决策）。"
    },
    "payload": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "业务字段容器。字段以 §2.1-§2.10 每类事件的表格为准；多出的未知字段不阻止消费（向后兼容），缺失必需字段视为脏数据。来源：event-contract.md §1 L19 + §1 L28。具体 payload 结构由本文件 allOf 中 event_type → $ref 的路由给出。",
      "additionalProperties": true
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "event_id",
    "event_type",
    "event_time",
    "ingest_time",
    "source_system",
    "schema_version",
    "trace_id",
    "payload"
  ],
  "additionalProperties": true,
  "x-contract-status": "DRAFT",
  "x-envelope-additional-properties": {
    "decision": "allowed (additionalProperties: true)",
    "x-unspecified": true,
    "rationale": "指导书与 event-contract.md 均未规定信封本身是否允许多出未知字段；§1 L28 的兼容性语句字面只覆盖 payload。此处沿用同一宽松策略，并在 README 待决策中登记，需总控按 V2.1 §9.1 冻结或收紧。"
  },
  "x-id-convention": {
    "x-unspecified": true,
    "rationale": "event-contract.md §1 L27 约定所有 ID（user_id/order_id/product_id 等）为数值字符串、event_id/trace_id 为 UUID 字符串；真实夹具 r9-m1-123006.jsonl 中 refund_id=R-1003-A、payment_id=P-1001 并非数值字符串，且 event_id/trace_id 并非 UUID，却均被采集层接受。为确保 schema 与真实可接受数据不矛盾，本文件对所有 ID 只约束 string，不强制数值/UUID 正则，冲突登记在 README 待决策。"
  },
  "x-evidence": [
    "docs/contracts/event-contract.md (schema_version 1.0)",
    "docs/项目完整实施指导书 V2.1.md §3.1/§3.3/§4.2",
    "landing/events/r9-m1-123006.jsonl (55 行真实夹具)",
    "landing/manifests/30.json (真实采集清单)",
    "analytics-server/platform-common/src/main/java/com/graduation/analytics/contracts/EventEnvelope.java",
    "analytics-server/platform-common/src/main/java/com/graduation/analytics/contracts/EventContract.java",
    "analytics-server/platform-common/src/test/java/com/graduation/analytics/contracts/CanonicalEventSchemaParityTest.java"
  ],
  "allOf": [
    {
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "event_type": {
            "const": "user_registered"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "event_type"
        ]
      },
      "then": {
        "properties": {
          "payload": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/user_registered"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "event_type": {
            "const": "product_created"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "event_type"
        ]
      },
      "then": {
        "properties": {
          "payload": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/product_created"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "event_type": {
            "const": "product_updated"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "event_type"
        ]
      },
      "then": {
        "properties": {
          "payload": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/product_updated"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "event_type": {
            "const": "behavior"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "event_type"
        ]
      },
      "then": {
        "properties": {
          "payload": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/behavior"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "event_type": {
            "const": "order_created"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "event_type"
        ]
      },
      "then": {
        "properties": {
          "payload": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/order_created"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "event_type": {
            "const": "order_paid"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "event_type"
        ]
      },
      "then": {
        "properties": {
          "payload": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/order_paid"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "event_type": {
            "const": "order_cancelled"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "event_type"
        ]
      },
      "then": {
        "properties": {
          "payload": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/order_cancelled"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "event_type": {
            "const": "refund_created"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "event_type"
        ]
      },
      "then": {
        "properties": {
          "payload": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/refund_created"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "event_type": {
            "const": "refund_completed"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "event_type"
        ]
      },
      "then": {
        "properties": {
          "payload": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/refund_completed"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "event_type": {
            "const": "stock_reserved"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "event_type"
        ]
      },
      "then": {
        "properties": {
          "payload": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/stock_reserved"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "event_type": {
            "const": "stock_released"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "event_type"
        ]
      },
      "then": {
        "properties": {
